ind":"announcement","title":"Corner Wars Demo is live for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Corner Wars is part of Steam Next Fest! The free demo of Corner Wars is now available – and we can't wait for you to jump in. Here's what you can expect: Classic Line Tower Wars, reimagined Corner Wars brings back the spirit of the legendary Line Tower Wars custom games – faster, more compact and built for modern players. Build your defense along your lane and send waves of units to overwhelm your opponents. Plays in the corner of your screen This is what makes Corner Wars unique: the game runs ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:35:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692661","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3170020-1839041357027946","game_id":"steam-3170020","kind":"update","title":"(Big) Update - New Look, New Features & More!","summary":"Massive Update – A New Look, New Features & Lots of ImprovementsOver the last few weeks, we've been hard at work improving Corner Wars, and we're excited to share one of our biggest updates yet.This update introduces a fresh visual identity, new gameplay systems, additional content, and a wide range of quality-of-life improvements across the game.A Fresh New LookWe've completely refreshed the presentation of Corner Wars with:A brand-new logoUpdated game visualsNew artwork for towers and sendsA c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T22:13:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027946","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3170020-1828894815558849","game_id":"steam-3170020","kind":"update","title":"Gameplay Update: New Fixed Send Paths","summary":"We’ve made an important gameplay change to improve the overall feel and clarity of Corner Wars — especially in its role as a corner-based game you play alongside other activities.What changed?Previously, send paths were dynamic and depended on each player’s build. While this created interesting situations, it could also make matches harder to read and less predictable — especially during fast-paced gameplay.With this update, send paths are now:Fixed for each roundRandomly generated at the start ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T22:53:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815558849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3170020-1828894815557192","game_id":"steam-3170020","kind":"announcement","title":"Corner Wars Demo Now Available!","summary":"We’re excited to announce that the Corner Wars Demo is officially live!Corner Wars is our take on classic Line Tower Wars — redesigned to fit seamlessly into your everyday workflow. Running directly in the corner of your screen, the game lets you jump into quick, strategic matches whenever you feel like it.Whether you have a few minutes or want to grind out strategies, the demo gives you a first look at what Corner Wars is all about.What you can expect in the demo:Play solo or in multiplayer wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T12:02:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815557192","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3170020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3170020":"2026-10-26T10:16:38Z"